    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "veto",
      "label": "your new hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal == 1"
      },
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "hand"
      ],
      "text": "Your hand for this deal:"
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "veto",
      "label": "the widow and the board",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal == 1"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Deal {deal} of {deals}. The Widow, face up for everyone, is {widow}. The Nyet board is empty. TRUMP line, in order: {trump_order}. LONE line: First = seat {veto_order[0]}, Second = seat {veto_order[1]}, Third = seat {veto_order[2]}."
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "veto",
      "label": "veto talk",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal == 1"
      },
      "to": "acting",
      "answer": {
        "type": "text",
        "max_words": 40
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} says: {value}"
      },
      "text": "Before the Nyet tokens go down, write one short message to the table. Everyone writes at the same time and all messages are shown together. Talk is not binding."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "veto",
      "label": "first nyet",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal == 1"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == veto_order[0]"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "trump_tokens",
              "value": "$answer",
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in trump_order"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "lone_tokens",
              "value": "$answer",
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in lone_line"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "players": "all",
              "key": "offer",
              "value": {
                "calc": "([c for c in trump_order if c not in trump_tokens] if len(trump_order) - len(trump_tokens) > 1 else []) + ([b for b in lone_line if b not in lone_tokens] if len(lone_tokens) < max_lone_tokens_per_deal and len(lone_line) - len(lone_tokens) > 1 else [])"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} (First) places a Nyet token on {value}."
      },
      "text": "You are First. Place one Nyet token on an empty box. A colour box vetoes that colour as trump; a LONE box (First, Second, Third) vetoes that position as the Lone. Tokens already placed: TRUMP {trump_tokens}, LONE {lone_tokens}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "veto",
      "label": "second nyet",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal == 1"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == veto_order[1]"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "trump_tokens",
              "value": "$answer",
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in trump_order"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "lone_tokens",
              "value": "$answer",
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in lone_line"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "players": "all",
              "key": "offer",
              "value": {
                "calc": "([c for c in trump_order if c not in trump_tokens] if len(trump_order) - len(trump_tokens) > 1 else []) + ([b for b in lone_line if b not in lone_tokens] if len(lone_tokens) < max_lone_tokens_per_deal and len(lone_line) - len(lone_tokens) > 1 else [])"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} (Second) places a Nyet token on {value}."
      },
      "text": "You are Second. Place one Nyet token on an empty box. A colour box vetoes that colour as trump; a LONE box vetoes that position as the Lone. Tokens already placed: TRUMP {trump_tokens}, LONE {lone_tokens}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "veto",
      "label": "third nyet",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal == 1"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == veto_order[2]"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "trump_tokens",
              "value": "$answer",
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in trump_order"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "lone_tokens",
              "value": "$answer",
              "if": {
                "calc": "$answer in lone_line"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} (Third) places a Nyet token on {value}."
      },
      "text": "You are Third. Place one Nyet token on an empty box. A colour box vetoes that colour as trump; a LONE box vetoes that position as the Lone. Tokens already placed: TRUMP {trump_tokens}, LONE {lone_tokens}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "veto",
      "label": "trump and the lone",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal == 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trump",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in trump_order if c not in trump_tokens][0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "lone_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "veto_order[0] if lone_line[0] not in lone_tokens else (veto_order[1] if lone_line[1] not in lone_tokens else veto_order[2])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "role",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'lone' if you.seat == lone_seat else 'pair'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "lone_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "widow"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "leader",
            "value": {
              "calc": "lone_seat"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "veto",
      "label": "trump and the lone announced",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal == 1"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Trump is {trump}. Seat {lone_seat} is the Lone and takes the Widow ({widow}), holding {lone_hand_size} cards. The other two seats are the Pair. Seat {lone_seat} leads the first trick."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "veto",
      "label": "your hand for the tricks",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal == 1"
      },
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "hand"
      ],
      "text": "Your hand for the tricks:"
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "lead",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal >= 2"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == leader"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "hand"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "trick_cards",
              "value": {
                "calc": "[]"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "trick_cards",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          },
          {
            "remove": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "hand",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "played_colour",
              "value": {
                "calc": "[c for c in colour_names if c[0] == $answer[0]][0]"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "played_rank",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer[len($answer) - 1])"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "key": "led_colour",
              "value": {
                "calc": "[c for c in colour_names if c[0] == $answer[0]][0]"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "players": "all",
              "key": "offer",
              "value": {
                "calc": "[c for c in you.hand if c[0] == led_colour[0]] if any(c[0] == led_colour[0] for c in you.hand) else you.hand"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} leads {value}."
      },
      "text": "You lead this trick. Play any card from your hand. Trump is {trump}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "second card",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal >= 2"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == leader % len(clockwise) + 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "trick_cards",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          },
          {
            "remove": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "hand",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "played_colour",
              "value": {
                "calc": "[c for c in colour_names if c[0] == $answer[0]][0]"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "played_rank",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer[len($answer) - 1])"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} plays {value}."
      },
      "text": "Cards played so far: {trick_cards}. Trump is {trump}. Play a card: if you hold the led colour you must follow it; otherwise any card."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "third card",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal >= 2"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == (leader + 1) % len(clockwise) + 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "each": {
        "do": [
          {
            "append": {
              "key": "trick_cards",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          },
          {
            "remove": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "hand",
              "value": "$answer"
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "played_colour",
              "value": {
                "calc": "[c for c in colour_names if c[0] == $answer[0]][0]"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "set": {
              "player": "$seat",
              "key": "played_rank",
              "value": {
                "calc": "int($answer[len($answer) - 1])"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "broadcast": {
        "to": "all",
        "text": "Seat {seat} plays {value}."
      },
      "text": "Cards played so far: {trick_cards}. Trump is {trump}. Play a card: if you hold the led colour you must follow it; otherwise any card."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "the trick is won",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal >= 2"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "strength",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(trump_strength_bonus if you.played_colour == trump else 0) + (led_strength_bonus if you.played_colour == led_colour else 0) + you.played_rank"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trick_winner",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.seat for p in acting if p.strength == max([q.strength for q in acting])])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            },
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "lone_trick_points"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "trick_winner == lone_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            },
            "key": "lone_tricks",
            "value": {
              "calc": "lone_trick_count_gain"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "trick_winner == lone_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.role == 'pair'"
            },
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pair_trick_points_each"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "trick_winner != lone_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            },
            "key": "last_win",
            "value": {
              "calc": "round"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "leader",
            "value": {
              "calc": "trick_winner"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "trick result",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal >= 2"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Cards played in order: {trick_cards}. Seat {trick_winner} wins the trick and leads next. Seat 1: score {acting[0].score}, lone tricks {acting[0].lone_tricks}, last win {acting[0].last_win}. Seat 2: score {acting[1].score}, lone tricks {acting[1].lone_tricks}, last win {acting[1].last_win}. Seat 3: score {acting[2].score}, lone tricks {acting[2].lone_tricks}, last win {acting[2].last_win}."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "your remaining hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round_in_deal >= 2"
      },
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "hand"
      ],
      "text": "Your remaining hand:"
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "trick",
      "label": "after round 36",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= total_rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= total_rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.score * rank_weight_score + you.lone_tricks * rank_weight_lone_tricks + you.last_win",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final scores: Seat 1 {acting[0].score} (lone tricks {acting[0].lone_tricks}, last win {acting[0].last_win}), Seat 2 {acting[1].score} (lone tricks {acting[1].lone_tricks}, last win {acting[1].last_win}), Seat 3 {acting[2].score} (lone tricks {acting[2].lone_tricks}, last win {acting[2].last_win})."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 36,
    "rounds_max": 36,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "There are exactly {players} players: seats 1, 2 and 3, clockwise 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 1. The deck has {deck_size} unique cards: {colours} colours (Red, Yellow, Green, Blue), each numbered 1 to {ranks_per_colour}. Everyone starts with score, lone_tricks and last_win at 0. The game lasts {total_rounds} rounds: {deals} deals of {rounds_per_deal} rounds each. Round 1 of each deal (rounds 1, 7, 13, 19, 25, 31) is the VETO round; rounds 2 to 6 of each deal are TRICK rounds ({tricks_per_deal} tricks per deal).\n\nVETO ORDER (First, Second, Third): deals 1 and 4: seats 1, 2, 3; deals 2 and 5: seats 2, 3, 1; deals 3 and 6: seats 3, 1, 2.\nTRUMP LINE ORDER: deals 1 and 5: Red, Yellow, Green, Blue; deals 2 and 6: Yellow, Green, Blue, Red; deal 3: Green, Blue, Red, Yellow; deal 4: Blue, Red, Yellow, Green.\n\nVETO ROUND\n(1) All {deck_size} cards are shuffled (cards left in hands from the previous deal are discarded unseen). Each player is dealt {hand_size} private cards. One of the remaining 9 is turned face up: the Widow, which everyone sees. The other {set_aside_cards} are set aside face down and never revealed.\n(2) The Nyet board is cleared. It has two lines: the TRUMP line ({trump_boxes} colour boxes, in this deal's order) and the LONE line ({lone_boxes} boxes: First, Second, Third). The Widow and the board are announced.\n(3) Talk: all three players write one short message at the same time, without seeing the others'. All messages are then shown to everyone. Talk is not binding.\n(4) First, then Second, then Third each places one Nyet token on one empty box ({tokens_per_deal} tokens per deal), seeing the tokens already placed. A token may go on any empty TRUMP box. A token may go on a LONE box only if no token is yet on the LONE line: at most {max_lone_tokens_per_deal} LONE token per deal; once one is there, only TRUMP boxes are offered. A player may not token the last empty box of a line, so that box is never offered. There is always at least one legal box; you are offered exactly the legal boxes.\n(5) Trump is the first untokened box on the TRUMP line, in this deal's order. The Lone is the seat at the first untokened box on the LONE line (First, then Second, then Third). The other two players are the Pair.\n(6) The Lone adds the Widow to their hand and holds {lone_hand_size} cards. Trump, the Lone and the Pair are announced. The Lone leads the first trick.\n\nTRICK ROUND\n(7) The leader plays one card face up. Then the next player clockwise plays one, then the third player. Each sees the cards already played. The led colour is the colour of the leader's card. A player holding a card of the led colour must play one (only those cards are offered); a player with none may play any card.\n(8) Winner: if any trump was played, the highest trump wins. Otherwise the highest card of the led colour wins. Cards are unique, so there is always one winner.\n(9) Scoring: if the Lone won, the Lone gains {lone_trick_points} points and {lone_trick_count_gain} lone_trick. If a Pair member won, each Pair member gains {pair_trick_points_each} point. The winner's last_win is set to the current round number.\n(10) The winner leads the next trick of this deal.\n(11) The cards played, the winner and all scores are announced.\nAfter the 5th trick of a deal, the Lone still holds {lone_cards_kept_back} card. It is never played or revealed and is discarded at the next shuffle. Choosing which card to keep back is the Lone's discard.\n\nEND\nAfter round {total_rounds} the game ends. The highest score wins. If players tie, the tied player with the most lone_tricks wins. If still tied, the tied player with the highest last_win wins (the one who won a trick most recently). Players still tied share the win as a draw."
}
